1
00:00:03,823 --> 00:00:05,283
(Leonard:)Oh, watch out, Sheldon.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:08,160
(Leonard:)This little boy Casper
is a gh... Gh... Gh... Ghost!

3
00:00:08,328 --> 00:00:10,788
- Ha-ha-ha.
- Droll.

4
00:00:10,997 --> 00:00:15,377
Eh, not as droll as a grown man
passed out in a puddle of his own urine.

5
00:00:16,794 --> 00:00:19,254
(Leonard:)That was pretty droll.
With a hint of ammonia.

6
00:00:21,799 --> 00:00:23,889
(Sheldon:)Yes, enjoy your japes, gentlemen.

7
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:26,600
(Sheldon:)Think you've poked fun
at a milquetoast academic.

8
00:00:26,763 --> 00:00:28,223
(Sheldon:)You've forgotten one thing.

9
00:00:28,389 --> 00:00:32,559
(Sheldon:)I am also a son of the Lone Star State.
I'm Texas through and through.

10
00:00:33,102 --> 00:00:36,142
(Sheldon:)And we know how
to settle scores down there.

11
00:00:36,314 --> 00:00:39,404
(Sheldon:)If you doubt me, ask Mexico.

12
00:00:42,403 --> 00:00:44,493
Hot girl, 9 o'clock.

13
00:00:44,656 --> 00:00:47,656
(Stuart:)Don't everybody look at once.

14
00:00:49,577 --> 00:00:51,457
(Raj:)What is she doing
in a comic book store?

15
00:00:51,621 --> 00:00:55,501
(Stuart:)I don't know. She might be lost.

16
00:00:56,125 --> 00:01:04,025
(Stuart:)Doesn't matter. Watch and learn.

